{
  "movie_id": 521300301,
  "subtitles": [
    {
      "index": 0,
      "start_time": 13.3,
      "end_time": 16.3,
      "text": "Now, all the Princesses, start cooking at the same time!"
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "start_time": 18.8,
      "end_time": 19.7,
      "text": "...?!"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "start_time": 19.9,
      "end_time": 23.2,
      "text": "Oh my! It seems we're already seeing a powerful move from Lyrael's group?!"
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "start_time": 25.6,
      "end_time": 28.1,
      "text": "Croce, engaging Cooking Mode♪"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "start_time": 29.6,
      "end_time": 31.3,
      "text": "DID YOU ALWAYS HAVE SUCH A MODE?!"
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "start_time": 31.5,
      "end_time": 32.8,
      "text": "Or rather, that bowl's HUGE!"
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "start_time": 33.0,
      "end_time": 34.4,
      "text": "Soryah! Whoa!"
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "start_time": 35.5,
      "end_time": 38.0,
      "text": "Amazing! She's done in no time at all..."
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "start_time": 38.3,
      "end_time": 41.4,
      "text": "But with that much dough... what kind of equipment could even bake it..."
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "start_time": 41.6,
      "end_time": 43.2,
      "text": "Get away from there at once, Croce"
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "start_time": 43.3,
      "end_time": 44.4,
      "text": "...?"
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "start_time": 45.4,
      "end_time": 48.1,
      "text": "Insolent scraps of dough..."
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "start_time": 50.5,
      "end_time": 51.9,
      "text": "Hey, what the hell are y-..."
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "start_time": 52.1,
      "end_time": 54.4,
      "text": "White Thunder Night Sky — Low Heat"
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "start_time": 56.7,
      "end_time": 58.0,
      "text": "GYAAAAAAHHHHHH!!!"
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "start_time": 60.3,
      "end_time": 61.4,
      "text": "...!"
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "start_time": 65.0,
      "end_time": 69.1,
      "text": "Ohh... This is truly a definition of \"Union Burst Cooking\"...!"
    },
    {
      "index": 17,
      "start_time": 69.3,
      "end_time": 71.5,
      "text": "WHAT'S WITH THAT?! I ALMOST DIED, YOU KNOW!!"
    },
    {
      "index": 18,
      "start_time": 72.0,
      "end_time": 72.8,
      "text": "..."
    },
    {
      "index": 19,
      "start_time": 73.0,
      "end_time": 74.9,
      "text": "This time, action's coming from the Nephy Nella group!"
    },
    {
      "index": 20,
      "start_time": 80.1,
      "end_time": 82.6,
      "text": "Transformation: Thousand-Handed Palm..."
    },
    {
      "index": 21,
      "start_time": 82.8,
      "end_time": 86.8,
      "text": "Don't just randomly debut some insane new move at a cooking competition!!!"
    },
    {
      "index": 22,
      "start_time": 88.0,
      "end_time": 91.0,
      "text": "Mone. How fare things on your end?"
    },
    {
      "index": 23,
      "start_time": 91.2,
      "end_time": 92.9,
      "text": "...So-so, I suppose..."
    },
    {
      "index": 24,
      "start_time": 94.9,
      "end_time": 100.1,
      "text": "Oh... such thoughtful attention to detail, even with the plate. As expected of Lady Anemone."
    },
    {
      "index": 25,
      "start_time": 100.3,
      "end_time": 102.1,
      "text": "She didn't even cook anything!"
    },
    {
      "index": 26,
      "start_time": 105.6,
      "end_time": 108.7,
      "text": "７、８、９──"
    },
    {
      "index": 27,
      "start_time": 109.2,
      "end_time": 112.6,
      "text": "Huh? I was sure I prepared ten of them..."
    },
    {
      "index": 28,
      "start_time": 114.0,
      "end_time": 116.0,
      "text": "No matter how many times you recount them..."
    },
    {
      "index": 29,
      "start_time": 116.2,
      "end_time": 117.9,
      "text": "YOU'RE ONE SHOOOOOORT!!"
    },
    {
      "index": 30,
      "start_time": 118.1,
      "end_time": 118.8,
      "text": "EEEEEEK!!!"
    },
    {
      "index": 31,
      "start_time": 121.2,
      "end_time": 125.2,
      "text": "Hehehe... I may have showed it off a little while inspecting the enemies' groups..."
    },
    {
      "index": 32,
      "start_time": 125.5,
      "end_time": 127.2,
      "text": "A Wraith's finest skill, that is"
    },
    {
      "index": 33,
      "start_time": 127.5,
      "end_time": 130.5,
      "text": "...! I-I cut my hand..."
    },
    {
      "index": 34,
      "start_time": 132.4,
      "end_time": 133.5,
      "text": "..."
    },
    {
      "index": 35,
      "start_time": 133.9,
      "end_time": 136.5,
      "text": "NO, THAT'S LITERALLY CUTTING YOUR HAND OFF ISN'T IT?!"
    },
    {
      "index": 36,
      "start_time": 136.8,
      "end_time": 141.0,
      "text": "This is... less cooking and more of a grotesque sight, I fear"
    },
    {
      "index": 37,
      "start_time": 141.2,
      "end_time": 143.0,
      "text": "IS THIS REALLY THE TIME FOR COMMENTARY!!"
    },
    {
      "index": 38,
      "start_time": 143.8,
      "end_time": 145.2,
      "text": "Again?"
    },
    {
      "index": 39,
      "start_time": 145.5,
      "end_time": 150.0,
      "text": "Ever since practice, it seems I'll always have to bring some with us... bandaids, that is"
    },
    {
      "index": 40,
      "start_time": 150.2,
      "end_time": 152.3,
      "text": "Will a bandaid even work here...?!"
    },
    {
      "index": 41,
      "start_time": 157.8,
      "end_time": 160.2,
      "text": "Seems like it did...!"
    },
    {
      "index": 42,
      "start_time": 162.4,
      "end_time": 165.8,
      "text": "I'm looking forward to seeing what kind of food everyone will prepare!"
    },
    {
      "index": 43,
      "start_time": 166.1,
      "end_time": 167.1,
      "text": "..."
    },
    {
      "index": 44,
      "start_time": 167.2,
      "end_time": 168.1,
      "text": "...Pecorine?"
    },
    {
      "index": 45,
      "start_time": 168.5,
      "end_time": 172.5,
      "text": "Ah, yes. I'm looking forward to it, too...☆"
    },
    {
      "index": 46,
      "start_time": 175.3,
      "end_time": 177.1,
      "text": "...?"
    }
  ],
